    "Refit from current full-scope result artifacts during the weekly gate-time check (#3283). Missing binaries receive defaultSeconds; stale names are ignored. Exact identity-union verification owns coverage.",
    "PR source records bind the tested merge commit separately from its head commit; every cohort result has exact disjoint PASS identities and confirmed private-world cleanup. Three real post-merge main runs remain required for timing acceptance; these weights are not that acceptance proof."
